  <steps>
    <step order="1">Invoke /code-review projects/record-header-and-notepad-r1/ — review all Phase 1-4 code; fix any critical issues before proceeding.</step>
    <step order="2">Invoke /adr-check on the project source files (src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/, src/client/pcf/MatterHeader/, src/solutions/Notepad/); resolve any Path A/B/C violations per CLAUDE.md §6.5.</step>
    <step order="3">Invoke /test-diet projects/record-header-and-notepad-r1/ (BINDING per CLAUDE.md §7); classify tests as MAINTAIN or SCAFFOLDING; execute any recommended git mv/rm; write report to notes/test-diet-report.md.</step>
