    <step order="9">Update projects/INDEX.md: change status column to "Complete pending PR merge" (or remove if PR is already merged).</step>
    <step order="10">Mark all rows in tasks/TASK-INDEX.md as ✅ completed.</step>
    <step order="11">Final verification: TASK-INDEX all ✅; graduation criteria all ✅; no critical code-review issues; no unresolved adr-check violations; test-diet report published.</step>
    <step order="12">If any deviations from plan, document in projects/record-header-and-notepad-r1/notes/final-deviations.md.</step>
  </steps>

